            </a>
          </div>
            <p>
                This edition took place at Lillimendelssohn, a Berlin knitwear label known for its distinctive use of colour, beautiful yarns and timeless design.
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>2.5 hours of guided, hands-on making</li>
              <li>All materials included: reclaimed fabrics, ribbons, buttons, beads, findings and more</li>
              <li>No experience needed. Beginners and crafty hands alike are equally welcome</li>
              <li>Two ways in: bring your own idea and build it at the buffet, or follow one of our simple guided designs</li>
              <li>Take home a wearable piece, a brooch, bow, ornament or accessory that's entirely your own</li>
              <li>No skills required. No pressure.</li>
              <li>Just good materials, good company, and a little time away from the screen.</li>
            </ul>

